<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent incidents continue in southern Thailand, with construction vehicles torched in Yala and attacks reported in three provinces prompting a border policy review. The Thai foreign minister has travelled to Myanmar for talks with Min Aung Hlaing on border security, while Thailand challenges Myanmar over arsenic-tainted rivers affecting cross-border water. Thai forces have deployed F‑16s to the Tak border and placed ten border provinces on alert, preparing evacuation centres for possible refugees. The insurgency now also involves disputes over water contamination and heightened diplomatic engagement, adding a cross-border environmental dimension to the conflict. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOS2dxa3BjSXFxcktBbjFhbkZYNEVhMVdYMjFUeDZwSUNfZUluRDJpODlBem9OQU9QZVhIXzN1V3g3RVJoREVVSkg4b0RKSTg3ZTZ2TS1PWFlKQU9kNUgtN3hWa2d5NUE0R0xOVnJDV3VhM2ltRklMMkx5d3lpU1Bza0JnVXdxczVDNFdfRmFWcjR1RElpUTF5dm5DTm1FblYyMTdNdGRUTGJ6TVJUT3h1TTB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE96WEpJSXBCSjlkSnVGNW5WVWlzTENMT2RiVFZodHJvLWZFQVVmNFN2VG5qOEQ4TWlXV3pDcy1pNlFZTk5ZZ1ZIVU1mMTV1TGRHYXBqOGhrX0FSbVd4LWxRamhKQUtQRGcxOE5FM2N0NjJKNnBkN3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Japan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h